FIXED_LIGHT
INDOOR_FLOOR
BUY_JEWELRY
CALL 33
*DESCRIPTION_START
Plush ruby colored carpeting muffles your footsteps as you enter this fine
establishment. Shimmering rainbows of light, created by hundreds of tear-
shaped crystals dangling from an enormous golden chandelier overhead, are
reflected in the spotless glass counters encircling the room. A distinquished
tuxcedo clad gentlemen standing between a pair of white marble columns carved
with heroic scenes, waits to assist you. For the Fall Festival, one counter
has been draped in cobwebs and filled with novelty jewelry, and a small sign
beside it lists the festival prices.
*DESCRIPTION_END
